values ('40415a8d-bb27-f3a4-37c7-c19749a349d2', 'the-business-of-community-101', 'The Business of Community 101', 'Frequency''s free four-week live workshop for anyone who gathers people. Four simple meetings on the PULSE rhythm, and one question: how many came back?', 'Frequency. Not the sound kind. The how-often kind. A community lives on one question: not how many people came, but how many came back.

This is the workbook for The Business of Community, Frequency''s free four-week live workshop for anyone who gathers people. It assumes you''re starting from scratch. Each week gives you one simple meeting you can run, on PULSE, the same rhythm every Frequency gathering uses: Presence, Unite, Lead, Settle, Exhale.

The workshop meets live on Zoom, 90 minutes each Thursday, several times a year. Each week is an overview and a lesson to read before the session, and homework after it: run the meeting once with your own people and report back. The launch Run starts January 7, 2027.', '78d47bae-c4c8-4d1c-80a0-ac69aaf98ef8', (select id from spaces where slug = 'hq'), 'public', 'approved', now(), 'Creator Lab', 'gentle', array['creator lab', 'core training', 'PULSE', 'hosting', 'community business', 'pricing', 'return frequency']::text[], 10, null, '{"format":"online","schedule":"Self-paced","timezone":"America/Los_Angeles","location":null,"link":null,"notes":null,"eventId":null,"gathering":null}'::jsonb, false, 0, true, '/brand/frequency/photos/gathering-03.jpg', true)
